OL,5,CMultiple editions:                     
OL,6, Right now, there are 4 editions, each  
OL,7, with their own purpose/target hardware:
OL,8, -BUltimate D64 image                   
OL,9, -BWiC64 D64 image                      
OL,10, -BWiC64 Stand Alone PRG (& WiC Portal) 
OL,11, -BMeatloaf stand alone PRG             
OL,13,CD64 editions                           
OL,14, The D64 editions offer the possibility 
OL,15, to configure wether to use the default 
OL,16,Fpetsciiproxy.nlGserver, or to host your
OL,17, own (local) PetsciiProxy installation. 
OL,19, On the diskette is a seperateFCONFIG   
OL,20, program to set user preferences. The   
OL,21,FUT64Gconfig file is stored locally on  
OL,22, the diskette.                          
